    'عَلَى <rule class=ham_wasl>ٱ</rule>لۡأَر<rule class=madda_obligatory_mottasel>َا</rule>ٓئِكِ يَ<rule class=ikhafa>نظ</rule>ُر<rule class=madda_permissible>ُو</rule>نَ ٢٣',
